WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.384 line:82%
Chapter 16. For students. Your words, your skills, and your certificates.

00:00:06.802 --> 00:00:13.925 line:82%
Put MI WAY on your home screen. On the "Welcome" page, tap this button, and follow the steps for your phone.

00:00:14.393 --> 00:00:19.125 line:82%
Next time, open MI WAY from its icon, on the class Wi-Fi.

00:00:19.579 --> 00:00:25.705 line:82%
Your teacher sends you words to learn. A message appears: "New words to learn". Tap it.

00:00:26.170 --> 00:00:30.504 line:82%
You see your level, and your words. Your list is for your level.

00:00:30.964 --> 00:00:38.924 line:82%
Tap a word to hear it. "Cards": say the word, then flip the card. "Quiz": practise, as many times as you want.

00:00:39.386 --> 00:00:48.523 line:82%
At home, there is no class Wi-Fi. So tap "Save for home". It saves one file. Open it at home: it works with no Wi-Fi.

00:00:48.982 --> 00:01:00.145 line:82%
Ready? Tap "Level test", on the class Wi-Fi. You have one try a day. Get 8 out of 10, and you go up a level: Starter, Explorer, Champion, and then the trophy!

00:01:00.602 --> 00:01:03.464 line:82%
Look at the picture, and choose the word.

00:01:16.569 --> 00:01:23.266 line:82%
Well done! Missed a word? It goes to "words to fix", at the top of your list. Learn it for next time.

00:01:23.721 --> 00:01:27.706 line:82%
Now your skills. Tap the menu button, then the brain.

00:01:28.505 --> 00:01:34.845 line:82%
Red is a skill to work on, yellow is getting better, and green is strong. Tap "Practise now".

00:01:35.310 --> 00:01:40.606 line:82%
Answer a few short questions. Your teacher sees your progress on the skill map.

00:01:55.654 --> 00:02:03.010 line:82%
A skill comes back a few days later, until it is green. "Save practice for home" works with no Wi-Fi.

00:02:03.472 --> 00:02:08.449 line:82%
Your teacher can also send you a certificate. It arrives with confetti!

00:02:08.903 --> 00:02:16.371 line:82%
Tap "Save picture" to keep it, or share it with your family. All your certificates are under the trophy, in the menu.

00:02:16.837 --> 00:02:23.710 line:82%
Hard to read? Tap "Aa" in the menu: bigger text, easy-read letters, or "Read questions to me".

00:02:24.167 --> 00:02:33.569 line:82%
Remember: your words, your skills and your trophies open only on the class Wi-Fi. So save them! Thank you for using MI WAY Classroom!
